WEBVTT

00:00:22.580 --> 00:00:23.070
Andre!

00:00:23.070 --> 00:00:23.980
Are you all right?!

00:00:23.980 --> 00:00:24.770
Shake it off!

00:00:31.680 --> 00:00:32.780
Hey, what—

00:00:44.600 --> 00:00:46.960
Who said you could take a break?

00:02:18.640 --> 00:02:20.490
Hachimitsu Private Academy.

00:02:20.490 --> 00:02:23.210
This boarding school, known for its strict discipline

00:02:23.210 --> 00:02:25.340
and outstanding record as a college-prep school,

00:02:25.340 --> 00:02:28.850
was about to face a major turning point.

00:02:28.850 --> 00:02:31.880
I heard there were a lot of
girls here before I enrolled,

00:02:31.880 --> 00:02:33.770
and to be honest, that's
the reason why I did.

00:02:34.210 --> 00:02:35.730
The male-to-female ratio is 1:200.

00:02:35.730 --> 00:02:38.290
Outrageous. Absolutely outrageous.

00:02:38.290 --> 00:02:40.840
I had so many dreams before I enrolled, you know?

00:02:40.840 --> 00:02:43.430
Like losing your virginity before April was even over.

00:02:43.430 --> 00:02:46.870
Never mind my virginity,
I haven't even <i>talked</i> to a girl yet.

00:02:46.870 --> 00:02:48.420
Will you hold your tongues?!

00:02:48.420 --> 00:02:49.960
Can you not concentrate

00:02:49.960 --> 00:02:50.630
a bit more?!

00:02:50.630 --> 00:02:52.270
Concentrate on what?

00:02:52.270 --> 00:02:52.830
You know what!

00:02:53.150 --> 00:02:55.060
On watching out for
downblouses and upskirts!

00:02:55.060 --> 00:02:57.460
Have any of you guys
talked to a girl so far?

00:02:57.460 --> 00:02:58.660
Not even once!

00:02:59.320 --> 00:03:00.090
Same here.

00:03:00.090 --> 00:03:01.970
Th-The same...

00:03:01.970 --> 00:03:05.430
What, you mean none of us has talked to them?

00:03:05.910 --> 00:03:09.390
Hachimitsu Academy used to be an all-girls school,

00:03:09.390 --> 00:03:12.590
but as of this year, they started accepting boys, too.

00:03:12.590 --> 00:03:14.220
Word on the street
is that policy changed

00:03:14.220 --> 00:03:16.580
right when the Council Chairman did.

00:03:16.580 --> 00:03:19.030
I'm... going in.

00:03:20.000 --> 00:03:21.190
I'm going to go talk to a girl.

00:03:21.630 --> 00:03:24.610
You should be content to just sit here and watch quietly!

00:03:24.610 --> 00:03:26.040
It would be rough to have the girls

00:03:26.040 --> 00:03:27.490
hate you so soon after enrolling.

00:03:27.490 --> 00:03:29.120
He's right, you really shouldn't.

00:03:29.120 --> 00:03:29.910
Shut up!

00:03:29.910 --> 00:03:32.060
I've always wanted to...

00:03:32.060 --> 00:03:35.200
wanted to play around with girls!

00:03:35.200 --> 00:03:36.330
Watch the way I live my life!

00:03:37.180 --> 00:03:37.880
So anyway...

00:03:37.880 --> 00:03:38.410
Um...

00:03:39.860 --> 00:03:41.480
Um, I...

00:03:42.090 --> 00:03:44.800
Crap! I didn't think
about what I would say!

00:03:44.800 --> 00:03:48.260
Uh... Um... I...

00:03:48.260 --> 00:03:48.970
Uh...

00:03:48.970 --> 00:03:50.680
Hey, do you two have a minute?

00:03:51.220 --> 00:03:51.730
Huh?

00:03:53.240 --> 00:03:55.020
I <i>told</i> him it was pointless.

00:03:55.630 --> 00:03:58.110
Yours truly has also zealously tried talking to them,

00:03:58.110 --> 00:04:01.520
but not a single lass
would talk back to me!

00:04:01.520 --> 00:04:03.430
Couldn't that be because you're repulsive?

00:04:03.430 --> 00:04:04.860
Emphatically not true!

00:04:05.620 --> 00:04:06.640
There were no survivors.

00:04:06.640 --> 00:04:08.490
Behold! The same thing happened to Kiyoshi-dono!

00:04:08.860 --> 00:04:11.830
We are in the girls' disfavor!

00:04:11.830 --> 00:04:13.910
So, what is it, Senpai?

00:04:14.270 --> 00:04:17.480
Did you see the handout that
was passed around yesterday?

00:04:17.480 --> 00:04:19.510
About the Underground Student Council?

00:04:19.510 --> 00:04:20.670
I thought it was a joke.

00:04:20.670 --> 00:04:23.670
If only it were a joke. At the very least,

00:04:24.210 --> 00:04:27.180
don't talk to boys where
the crows can see you.

00:04:27.960 --> 00:04:30.640
Not if you want to survive at this school.

00:04:33.180 --> 00:04:35.610
Class time is the most nerve-wracking time of all.

00:04:35.610 --> 00:04:38.690
I'm the only boy in the whole class.

00:04:40.930 --> 00:04:44.140
Ah, geez... I'm trying not to draw any attention here!

00:04:49.530 --> 00:04:50.160
Raiden...

00:04:50.930 --> 00:04:52.080
Tame'emon.

00:04:52.080 --> 00:04:52.790
Huh?

00:04:56.830 --> 00:04:59.210
Thanks to this weird
eraser Mom gave me,

00:04:59.210 --> 00:05:02.200
I've repulsed Chiyo-san, the prettiest girl in class!

00:05:02.200 --> 00:05:04.620
This sucks so bad!

00:05:06.720 --> 00:05:07.400
Um...

00:05:08.450 --> 00:05:09.980
Do you like...

00:05:09.980 --> 00:05:10.800
sumo wrestling?

00:05:11.780 --> 00:05:13.560
I have the same eraser.

00:05:16.620 --> 00:05:17.570
I...

00:05:18.280 --> 00:05:19.270
<i>love</i> sumo wrestling!

00:05:19.270 --> 00:05:21.020
Kiyoshi-dono is tardy.

00:05:21.020 --> 00:05:21.970
You don't suppose he's with a gi—

00:05:21.970 --> 00:05:23.660
Nah, there's no way.

00:05:23.660 --> 00:05:25.360
Maybe he has an upset stomach.

00:05:25.360 --> 00:05:28.240
Kiyoshi-dono does have the countenance of one with a fragile constitution.

00:05:31.540 --> 00:05:33.490
We talked about sumo wrestling.

00:05:33.490 --> 00:05:35.320
Kiyoshi-dono is tardy!

00:05:35.320 --> 00:05:36.060
He really <i>is</i> with a gi—

00:05:36.060 --> 00:05:37.620
I told you, there's no way.

00:05:37.620 --> 00:05:39.050
Then, he has an upset stomach.

00:05:39.050 --> 00:05:41.710
Kiyoshi-dono does have the countenance of one easily touched by diarrhea.

00:05:44.060 --> 00:05:46.720
We talked a lot about sumo wrestling.

00:05:50.680 --> 00:05:54.630
Ah, I had no idea I had a sumo fan sitting near me.

00:05:54.630 --> 00:05:55.890
I'm surprised, too.

00:05:55.890 --> 00:05:57.850
Though, I'm just parroting Mom here.

00:05:58.260 --> 00:06:00.940
Kiyoshi-kun, would you be interested in a Student Sumo League?

00:06:00.940 --> 00:06:01.840
Huh?

00:06:01.840 --> 00:06:04.500
I'm not sure if I'd want to go that far...

00:06:04.500 --> 00:06:05.330
but I am interested!

00:06:05.330 --> 00:06:05.900
Really?

00:06:06.380 --> 00:06:08.140
There's a tournament coming up.

00:06:09.780 --> 00:06:11.070
Would you like to go with me?

00:06:14.150 --> 00:06:16.450
Oh, sorry! Maybe I
shouldn't have asked!

00:06:16.770 --> 00:06:18.080
I'll go! I'll definitely go!

00:06:21.700 --> 00:06:22.960
"Thank you very much."

00:06:26.430 --> 00:06:27.880
She's so cute!

00:06:30.070 --> 00:06:33.520
Hey, what's that you keep doing over there? It's creepy.

00:06:33.520 --> 00:06:35.180
Are you even listening to us?

00:06:35.180 --> 00:06:35.680
Sorry.

00:06:36.250 --> 00:06:37.410
What are we talking about?

00:06:37.410 --> 00:06:38.890
I told you!

00:06:38.890 --> 00:06:39.790
Peeping?!

00:06:39.790 --> 00:06:41.660
You idiot! Keep your voice down!

00:06:41.660 --> 00:06:42.600
Where are we going to peep?

00:06:43.610 --> 00:06:44.980
The girls' baths.

00:06:44.980 --> 00:06:45.680
Can we?!

00:06:45.680 --> 00:06:46.950
Of course not!

00:06:46.950 --> 00:06:47.940
Then that's out.

00:06:47.940 --> 00:06:50.560
Have you ever seen a girl's boobs?

00:06:50.560 --> 00:06:51.160
No.

00:06:51.160 --> 00:06:52.200
Me neither!

00:06:52.610 --> 00:06:56.530
Kiyoshi-dono, have you had the experience of witnessing a girl's bare bottom?

00:06:56.530 --> 00:06:59.450
P-P***y... P-P***y!

00:06:59.450 --> 00:07:00.380
All of it—

00:07:01.410 --> 00:07:02.870
Joe, you're coughing up blood!

00:07:02.870 --> 00:07:06.090
It's okay. It's just Joe-kun's nasty canker sores.

00:07:06.090 --> 00:07:09.550
Boobs, butts, and "that down there," the complete set...

00:07:13.310 --> 00:07:14.430
Let's go.

00:07:14.830 --> 00:07:16.900
Now then, our watchword shall be...

00:07:17.870 --> 00:07:21.970
"One for all, and all for one."

00:07:21.970 --> 00:07:22.770
Furthermore...

00:07:22.770 --> 00:07:24.480
"Death to all traitors!"

00:07:25.010 --> 00:07:26.440
And now, sally forth!

00:07:27.240 --> 00:07:28.850
According to yours truly's research,

00:07:28.850 --> 00:07:31.400
Class 1-1 has the greatest
number of cute girls!

00:07:31.400 --> 00:07:32.010
Yeah!

00:07:32.010 --> 00:07:32.450
Huh?

00:07:32.450 --> 00:07:33.910
Class 1-1?

00:07:33.910 --> 00:07:35.070
That's my class.

00:07:35.720 --> 00:07:36.320
Which means...

00:07:37.030 --> 00:07:40.200
Ch-Ch-Chiyo-chan!

00:07:40.200 --> 00:07:41.930
No! Absolutely not!

00:07:41.930 --> 00:07:44.560
I can't let this bunch
see Chiyo-chan naked!

00:07:44.560 --> 00:07:46.170
But if I say something...

00:07:46.170 --> 00:07:47.630
Death to all traitors!

00:07:48.540 --> 00:07:49.960
What do I do?

00:07:49.960 --> 00:07:51.460
Eros...

00:07:51.920 --> 00:07:52.920
or Thanatos?

00:07:58.200 --> 00:08:01.350
Tell me, how do we peep from here?

00:08:01.350 --> 00:08:03.030
Yeah, what a shame!

00:08:03.030 --> 00:08:05.490
Here I thought we would be able to see naked girls,

00:08:05.490 --> 00:08:06.490
but I guess we'll have to—

00:08:06.490 --> 00:08:07.940
Fear not!

00:08:07.940 --> 00:08:09.690
I am prepared for this contingency.

00:08:10.120 --> 00:08:11.530
These have a videophone function?!

00:08:11.530 --> 00:08:14.530
Indeed. We dangle this smartphone on a rope from the skylight,

00:08:14.530 --> 00:08:18.730
and relish the view of the changing room on this smartphone.

00:08:18.730 --> 00:08:20.180
No, no, no, that's no good!

00:08:20.180 --> 00:08:23.040
Even yours truly had to "execute Ma Su with tears."

00:08:23.400 --> 00:08:25.200
It was a bitter decision!

00:08:33.420 --> 00:08:34.250
See anything?

00:08:34.250 --> 00:08:36.050
Hey, guys, let's stop, really!

00:08:36.570 --> 00:08:40.430
There's no way I'm going to let
these guys see Chiyo-chan naked!

00:08:40.430 --> 00:08:42.560
I'd rather push them over the edge!

00:08:43.960 --> 00:08:44.680
Huh?

00:08:45.150 --> 00:08:46.020
Chiyo-chan?

00:08:46.380 --> 00:08:49.230
Which means she's no longer in the changing room.

00:08:49.230 --> 00:08:51.320
Okay! You guys win.

00:08:51.800 --> 00:08:54.040
If your minds are this
made up on the matter,

00:08:54.040 --> 00:08:55.700
then I'm with you all the way!

00:08:55.700 --> 00:08:58.870
Here, I'll dangle it down,
you guys watch first.

00:08:59.340 --> 00:09:01.320
Well, it is your phone, after all,

00:09:01.320 --> 00:09:03.140
so that probably works best.

00:09:03.140 --> 00:09:04.840
Yeah, leave it to me.

00:09:04.840 --> 00:09:05.960
After all, it's my—

00:09:05.960 --> 00:09:06.960
Huh? Mine?!

00:09:17.540 --> 00:09:18.560
Thank goodness! No one's there!

00:09:18.560 --> 00:09:19.140
It's a miracle!

00:09:19.140 --> 00:09:22.360
Kiyoshi-dono, what ignominy! We should have your head!

00:09:22.360 --> 00:09:24.910
Damn it, Gakuto, why did you use my smartphone without asking?!

00:09:24.910 --> 00:09:27.670
Never mind, Kiyoshi, go get it, quick! Someone will see it!

00:09:27.670 --> 00:09:28.230
Why <i>me</i>?!

00:09:28.230 --> 00:09:29.600
It's <i>your</i> smartphone!

00:09:36.070 --> 00:09:36.820
Successfully located!

00:09:36.820 --> 00:09:39.530
Superlative work! Return at once—

00:09:46.250 --> 00:09:47.040
Chiyo-chan?!

00:09:48.160 --> 00:09:49.040
Who are you?

00:09:49.040 --> 00:09:52.450
My love, my adolescence,
my high school life,

00:09:52.450 --> 00:09:53.510
are all over now.

00:09:53.510 --> 00:09:56.570
I'll be branded as a pervert, have to drop out of school,

00:09:56.570 --> 00:09:59.010
and live my whole life with
people pointing fingers at me!

00:09:59.530 --> 00:10:00.470
Let's split.

00:10:02.870 --> 00:10:03.680
Is that you...

00:10:05.650 --> 00:10:07.100
Mayumi?

00:10:09.130 --> 00:10:11.500
I said you could go on in without me, you know.

00:10:11.500 --> 00:10:12.000
Huh?

00:10:12.000 --> 00:10:14.130
I took my contacts out, and I ended up bumping

00:10:14.130 --> 00:10:15.910
into all sorts of things on my way here.

00:10:15.910 --> 00:10:17.320
You mean Chiyo-chan is nearsighted?!

00:10:17.320 --> 00:10:18.650
That means...

00:10:18.650 --> 00:10:19.700
...we're still safe?

00:10:22.320 --> 00:10:25.490
Chiyo-chan is getting undressed? Right behind me?

00:10:28.040 --> 00:10:30.170
Mayumi, why aren't
you getting undressed?

00:10:30.170 --> 00:10:31.830
We don't have much time.

00:10:37.960 --> 00:10:39.590
Why are you getting undressed?!

00:10:39.590 --> 00:10:43.050
Chiyo-chan, hurry on into
the baths so I can sneak out.

00:10:43.880 --> 00:10:46.890
All right, let's go, Mayumi.

00:10:46.890 --> 00:10:48.820
When she says "let's go," does she mean...?

00:10:48.820 --> 00:10:53.190
Kiyoshi-dono, are you showing us your sacrificial spirit?!

00:10:57.520 --> 00:10:58.480
Heaven!

00:10:58.790 --> 00:11:00.490
You are a samurai.

00:11:01.940 --> 00:11:04.500
Are we going to let Kiyoshi go in alone?

00:11:04.500 --> 00:11:05.430
You're right.

00:11:05.430 --> 00:11:08.010
We can't let him play
the hero all by himself.

00:11:08.010 --> 00:11:08.850
Muffins.

00:11:08.850 --> 00:11:10.460
We must go in, too.

00:11:10.880 --> 00:11:11.920
To Heaven!

00:11:12.320 --> 00:11:14.600
Hmm? Andre-dono, you have a crow on your head.

00:11:14.600 --> 00:11:15.840
Muffin? Muffin!

00:11:15.840 --> 00:11:17.480
Gakuto! There's one
on your crotch, too!

00:11:17.480 --> 00:11:19.200
Crows!

00:11:19.200 --> 00:11:19.880
The crows...!

00:11:35.920 --> 00:11:39.190
A boy in my class said he'd go with me to the Student Sumo Matches.

00:11:39.630 --> 00:11:41.700
You know, I really don't
understand this whole

00:11:41.700 --> 00:11:44.410
"one week's punishment for having contact with a boy."

00:11:44.410 --> 00:11:47.490
What's with this "prison" and
"Underground Student Council" talk?

00:11:47.490 --> 00:11:49.540
"Underground Student Council"? What's that?

00:11:49.540 --> 00:11:51.870
Ah, there you are.
Did you find your shampoo?

00:11:51.870 --> 00:11:53.330
Huh? Mayumi?

00:11:53.330 --> 00:11:56.570
I came in first since you said you needed to go back and get your shampoo, didn't you?

00:11:56.570 --> 00:11:57.960
Huh? But, wait a minute...

00:11:57.960 --> 00:12:00.340
Then, who are you?

00:12:00.340 --> 00:12:02.670
Ah! Get away! Get away!

00:12:08.550 --> 00:12:10.140
Who goes there?!

00:12:10.140 --> 00:12:11.860
Sorry about that. My mistake.

00:12:11.860 --> 00:12:12.990
What do I do? What do I do?

00:12:12.990 --> 00:12:14.350
So, who are you?

00:12:14.350 --> 00:12:16.040
Don't be cranky, tell me.

00:12:17.460 --> 00:12:20.150
Is this the last chapter of my life?

00:12:21.090 --> 00:12:22.940
The boys are peeping!

00:12:22.940 --> 00:12:25.200
The Underground Student Council
caught them and put them in the quad!

00:12:25.600 --> 00:12:26.490
Everyone gather there!

00:12:26.490 --> 00:12:27.680
Huh? I haven't taken my bath yet.

00:12:27.680 --> 00:12:29.230
What are you talking about?!

00:12:29.230 --> 00:12:30.940
Hey, you should hurry, too.

00:12:30.940 --> 00:12:31.540
Huh?

00:12:31.540 --> 00:12:32.500
I'll leave now, Chiyo!

00:12:32.500 --> 00:12:33.370
Wait!

00:12:36.200 --> 00:12:38.330
Bwah! I'm saved!

00:12:48.330 --> 00:12:49.720
Where's the other one?

00:12:49.720 --> 00:12:50.720
The other one is—

00:12:50.720 --> 00:12:53.430
The four of us alone peeped!

00:12:53.430 --> 00:12:55.520
Ha, I know that's not true.

00:12:55.940 --> 00:12:58.160
Tell me quickly, for your crotch's sake.

00:12:59.810 --> 00:13:01.140
Let them have it.

00:13:01.140 --> 00:13:02.280
All right!

00:13:04.970 --> 00:13:06.490
Wh-What are they doing out there?

00:13:06.490 --> 00:13:08.450
That is the Underground Student Council.

00:13:09.490 --> 00:13:11.740
You're a new student, right?

00:13:11.740 --> 00:13:12.540
Here, take this.

00:13:12.540 --> 00:13:15.160
"Underground Student Council
Official Underground Guide Book"?

00:13:15.620 --> 00:13:17.670
So is it official, or is it underground?

00:13:18.200 --> 00:13:21.250
This is the Underground Student
Council secretary, Midorikawa Hana.

00:13:22.000 --> 00:13:25.260
That's the Underground Student
Council vice president, Shiraki Meiko.

00:13:25.860 --> 00:13:28.530
The Underground Student Council girls primarily crack down

00:13:28.530 --> 00:13:31.690
on any illicit sexual relations here at the school.

00:13:31.690 --> 00:13:33.640
Huh? Then who is the president?

00:13:33.640 --> 00:13:35.770
Oh, I'm sorry. A page back.

00:13:36.430 --> 00:13:38.790
"The Underground Student Council's 20th president,

00:13:38.790 --> 00:13:41.150
known as Mari the Crowmaster."

00:13:41.150 --> 00:13:43.650
You're telling me...

00:13:46.030 --> 00:13:47.210
President...

00:13:49.490 --> 00:13:51.320
Kiyoshi-dono!

00:13:51.320 --> 00:13:53.280
Impressive, President.

00:13:53.280 --> 00:13:54.950
Boys really are scum.

00:13:56.280 --> 00:13:57.160
Chiyo-chan...

00:14:01.770 --> 00:14:03.500
Look, it's those peepers.

00:14:03.500 --> 00:14:04.310
Gross.

00:14:04.310 --> 00:14:05.210
What sickos.

00:14:05.210 --> 00:14:06.000
Disgusting.

00:14:06.340 --> 00:14:08.220
I wish they would die.

00:14:12.980 --> 00:14:16.310
For the vile crime of ignoring the
human rights of your female victims,

00:14:16.730 --> 00:14:18.850
there is no room for clemency.

00:14:19.490 --> 00:14:20.060
As such,

00:14:20.820 --> 00:14:22.810
the five accused...

00:14:24.610 --> 00:14:28.530
are sentenced to serve
one month in prison!

00:14:34.970 --> 00:14:36.410
I will warn you upfront

00:14:37.280 --> 00:14:39.870
to offer absolute obedience to the Underground Student Council.

00:14:40.800 --> 00:14:43.580
Do not think of doing anything foolish, such as breaking out of here.

00:14:43.960 --> 00:14:45.790
If even one of you breaks out of here,

00:14:45.790 --> 00:14:49.020
all of your detention periods will be extended by one month.

00:14:49.020 --> 00:14:52.030
A second escape will add three months,

00:14:52.030 --> 00:14:53.860
and a third escape will mean expulsion.

00:14:54.530 --> 00:14:56.220
That is all. Any questions?

00:14:56.220 --> 00:14:58.430
You dare condemn us for violating human rights,

00:14:58.430 --> 00:15:00.690
then incarcerate us
here for a whole month—

00:15:01.200 --> 00:15:03.150
Refrain from speaking unless spoken to.

00:15:04.590 --> 00:15:06.270
What about our classes?

00:15:06.650 --> 00:15:09.740
There's no problem, you will take
your classes through this monitor.

00:15:09.740 --> 00:15:13.430
I know! I'll have my parents appeal
to the Board of Education over this!

00:15:13.430 --> 00:15:14.060
Go ahead.

00:15:14.060 --> 00:15:15.520
Huh? You mean it?

00:15:15.520 --> 00:15:16.450
Of course.

00:15:17.020 --> 00:15:19.380
Go ahead and confess to your parents personally

00:15:19.380 --> 00:15:21.290
that you were caught peeping.

00:15:21.920 --> 00:15:25.590
Tell them that while you'd normally be expelled, you have an in-school suspension.

00:15:26.420 --> 00:15:28.420
Choose whichever option you prefer:

00:15:28.420 --> 00:15:29.880
Expulsion...

00:15:30.880 --> 00:15:33.360
or behaving yourselves in here for a single month.

00:15:35.670 --> 00:15:37.390
You will now be put to work.

00:15:37.390 --> 00:15:41.960
Use those materials to erect a barricade around the prison within three days.

00:15:41.960 --> 00:15:45.520
After school time for yours truly is set
aside for study of the Three Kingdoms!

00:15:46.240 --> 00:15:48.540
Do not speak without my permission.

00:15:48.540 --> 00:15:50.260
Do the rest of you understand?

00:15:50.260 --> 00:15:52.030
If you do not obey me,

00:15:52.030 --> 00:15:53.600
you will be taught a similar lesson.

00:16:02.870 --> 00:16:04.380
Chiyo-chan...

00:16:07.330 --> 00:16:09.880
Who said you could
drink without permission?

00:16:09.880 --> 00:16:10.940
I apologize, I forgot to ask—

00:16:10.940 --> 00:16:14.430
If you can't learn by listening,
you'll have to learn the hard way!

00:16:14.930 --> 00:16:17.450
Hey, no matter what he's done, you're going too far!

00:16:17.450 --> 00:16:18.910
Take it easy, Kiyoshi-kun.

00:16:18.910 --> 00:16:20.230
Get back to work!

00:16:21.020 --> 00:16:21.990
What's the matter?

00:16:21.990 --> 00:16:23.640
He has a frail constitution!

00:16:23.640 --> 00:16:28.060
Our inquiries say that this boy has extreme canker sores.

00:16:28.060 --> 00:16:31.070
What else is wrong with you? Tell me. Huh?

00:16:32.120 --> 00:16:32.820
***k.

00:16:32.820 --> 00:16:36.490
It sounds like the only thing
wrong with you is your mouth!

00:16:37.190 --> 00:16:39.990
Pretending to be his friend?
You make me sick.

00:16:41.370 --> 00:16:44.100
Andre, it's okay. Thanks.

00:16:44.100 --> 00:16:46.610
I've got a huge body, so it's fine.

00:16:46.610 --> 00:16:47.560
Interesting.

00:16:47.560 --> 00:16:50.340
Hey, fatty, my boots
got dirty thanks to you.

00:16:50.340 --> 00:16:51.840
Lick them clean.

00:16:53.880 --> 00:16:55.260
What's wrong?

00:16:55.650 --> 00:16:57.640
If you can't do that,
then get back to work.

00:17:05.240 --> 00:17:06.690
Enough, already.

00:17:07.090 --> 00:17:09.940
Whatever he's done, there's no need to make him do <i>that.</i>

00:17:10.890 --> 00:17:11.900
Why, you...

00:17:11.900 --> 00:17:14.490
It's okay, Kiyoshi-kun. I'll lick it.

00:17:14.490 --> 00:17:15.800
No, it's not okay!

00:17:15.800 --> 00:17:18.320
If there's a good reason why he should lick your boots, then explain it to me!

00:17:20.160 --> 00:17:22.660
That's enough work for today.

00:17:24.490 --> 00:17:26.390
Are you guys okay?

00:17:26.390 --> 00:17:28.700
Except for me, everyone got worked over.

00:17:28.700 --> 00:17:29.840
Kiyoshi-kun...

00:17:29.840 --> 00:17:32.250
You don't have to thank me. You're all my buds, after all.

00:17:32.810 --> 00:17:37.340
Would you mind not talking to me during work tomorrow?

00:17:37.340 --> 00:17:38.040
Huh?

00:17:38.040 --> 00:17:39.590
Would you do the same for me, too?

00:17:39.590 --> 00:17:41.440
Yours truly is in agreement.

00:17:41.440 --> 00:17:42.180
Me, too.

00:17:42.180 --> 00:17:45.220
What's with you guys? What did I do?!

00:17:45.220 --> 00:17:47.850
Andre! You must
have been peeved, right?

00:17:47.850 --> 00:17:49.740
Yeah, I was peeved.

00:17:49.740 --> 00:17:52.990
Peeved that I didn't get to lick the vice president's boots!

00:17:52.990 --> 00:17:55.230
Why did you stop me?!
I was this close to licking them!

00:17:55.230 --> 00:17:56.700
I know! I know, Andre!

00:17:56.700 --> 00:17:57.750
I wanted to lick them, too!

00:17:57.750 --> 00:17:59.650
There's still hope for tomorrow!

00:17:59.650 --> 00:18:01.790
You guys can't possibly
mean you want to...

00:18:01.790 --> 00:18:03.660
That's what we should be asking you!

00:18:04.210 --> 00:18:08.540
It confounds me that any boy would not be delighted to be pushed around by a girl that pretty!

00:18:08.540 --> 00:18:12.950
Yours truly has never beheld a girl's legs or panties so close-up before!

00:18:12.950 --> 00:18:14.500
Me, too, Gakuto!

00:18:14.500 --> 00:18:16.210
Her spit was so delicious!

00:18:16.210 --> 00:18:17.970
I got to say "***k" to a girl!

00:18:17.970 --> 00:18:20.930
They smelled so good!

00:18:21.710 --> 00:18:22.710
or so I thought.

00:18:22.710 --> 00:18:26.440
You think you're going to be finished with your work by tomorrow at this rate?

00:18:26.440 --> 00:18:27.800
But as it turned out, it wasn't so bad.

00:18:27.800 --> 00:18:29.850
Damn it, I won't bow to your violence!

00:18:29.850 --> 00:18:33.260
My queen! I mean, Vice President!
His failure is yours truly's failure as well!

00:18:33.260 --> 00:18:35.450
Please, punish me, as well!

00:18:35.450 --> 00:18:36.110
No, me!

00:18:36.110 --> 00:18:37.260
***k me, please!

00:18:37.260 --> 00:18:37.820
Boots!

00:18:37.820 --> 00:18:39.360
Stay away from me!

00:18:39.360 --> 00:18:42.030
It looks like the vice president's actions have backfired.

00:18:42.800 --> 00:18:44.530
I think I'll send Hana.

00:18:44.530 --> 00:18:48.890
Allow me to introduce the Underground Student Council's secretary, Midorikawa Hana.

00:18:48.890 --> 00:18:51.630
From now on, she will oversee you alongside me.

00:18:51.630 --> 00:18:54.250
My pleasure! The president asked me to come.

00:18:54.250 --> 00:18:55.280
She's pretty cute.

00:18:55.280 --> 00:18:56.260
I fancy her.

00:18:56.260 --> 00:18:56.960
I want a lick.

00:18:57.440 --> 00:19:01.930
All right... Let's spend the day
hunting for four leaf clovers!

00:19:01.930 --> 00:19:04.850
We'll press them and put them in bookmarks, sell them at a booth,

00:19:04.850 --> 00:19:08.140
then donate the money to underprivileged kids, so do your best.

00:19:08.140 --> 00:19:11.280
"Four-leaf clover, little clover of happiness."

00:19:11.280 --> 00:19:12.880
Hana-san is nice, huh?

00:19:12.880 --> 00:19:16.110
Hmm, I like what's over
there a whole lot more.

00:19:19.320 --> 00:19:22.570
Ho! Indeed, what lies yonder is favorable, as well!

00:19:22.570 --> 00:19:23.460
I know, right?

00:19:23.460 --> 00:19:25.490
They're a far better sight
than this cold tamale.

00:19:25.490 --> 00:19:28.720
What are you all talking about?
Have you found any clovers yet?

00:19:28.720 --> 00:19:30.960
Ah, yes, yes, we're looking hard.

00:19:30.960 --> 00:19:31.830
Huh?

00:19:31.830 --> 00:19:32.580
Eh?

00:19:32.580 --> 00:19:35.510
You only say "yes" once, you third-rate worm!

00:19:37.880 --> 00:19:42.010
I forgot to mention that Hana is one of
the inter-high best-four karate masters.

00:19:42.010 --> 00:19:42.590
Hi there.

00:19:42.590 --> 00:19:43.090
Hi there!

00:19:43.810 --> 00:19:46.440
So the prison actually exists...

00:19:46.440 --> 00:19:48.600
I'm glad I didn't have anything to do with those boys.

00:19:48.600 --> 00:19:50.740
I wish they'd just kick
them out of school.

00:19:50.740 --> 00:19:53.350
No one who likes sumo
wrestling can be bad.

00:19:53.350 --> 00:19:55.080
Huh? Did you say something?

00:19:55.080 --> 00:19:55.810
No.

00:19:56.960 --> 00:19:59.980
Oh, you sure found a lot! Good work, good work!

00:19:59.980 --> 00:20:01.650
Huh? Why are there
three-leaf clovers in here,

00:20:01.650 --> 00:20:03.280
you second-bananas?!

00:20:03.280 --> 00:20:04.860
Thrashings from this girl...

00:20:04.860 --> 00:20:06.570
...are utterly devoid of enjoyment.

00:20:06.570 --> 00:20:07.910
She's too serious.

00:20:07.910 --> 00:20:09.120
What's more...

00:20:09.120 --> 00:20:13.160
Why is she wearing
leggings under her skirt?!

00:20:13.160 --> 00:20:15.580
We won't be able to derive any joy from this girl!

00:20:15.990 --> 00:20:17.460
Now, go look again, okay?

00:20:17.460 --> 00:20:19.390
Okay!

00:20:19.390 --> 00:20:21.970
I can't say I'm liking this herb tea.

00:20:21.970 --> 00:20:24.550
How mean! This is my original blend!

00:20:24.550 --> 00:20:26.370
I like the vice president better.

00:20:27.760 --> 00:20:29.640
I'm going to go look over there.

00:20:48.240 --> 00:20:49.380
I knew it.

00:20:49.770 --> 00:20:51.620
No one who likes sumo
wrestling can be bad.

00:20:54.580 --> 00:20:57.470
I have to apologize
about the peeping thing.

00:20:57.470 --> 00:20:58.980
She may hate me,

00:20:58.980 --> 00:21:01.500
but if I tell her honestly, she may forgive me.

00:21:02.270 --> 00:21:02.810
Um, I—

00:21:02.810 --> 00:21:03.960
You didn't do it, did you?

00:21:04.540 --> 00:21:07.840
Kiyoshi-kun, you weren't peeping, were you?

00:21:11.110 --> 00:21:11.690
No.

00:21:11.690 --> 00:21:12.640
Thank goodness!

00:21:13.200 --> 00:21:14.310
We're dead.

00:21:14.310 --> 00:21:16.330
After this much searching, we only found one.

00:21:16.330 --> 00:21:18.920
That Hana girl is gonna kill us for sure.

00:21:18.920 --> 00:21:24.120
Chums, there may be but one way to escape that girl's violence.

00:21:24.120 --> 00:21:24.860
Really?!

00:21:24.860 --> 00:21:26.810
Huh? Just one?

00:21:26.810 --> 00:21:27.860
Do you want to die?

00:21:28.210 --> 00:21:31.490
Hana-senpai, were you aware that each

00:21:31.490 --> 00:21:33.540
of the clover's four leaves has its own meaning?

00:21:33.540 --> 00:21:34.040
Huh?

00:21:34.640 --> 00:21:35.290
Hope.

00:21:35.290 --> 00:21:36.040
Integrity.

00:21:36.040 --> 00:21:37.000
Good fortune.

00:21:37.000 --> 00:21:39.000
As well as love.

00:21:39.640 --> 00:21:42.000
Which is to say, we are a four-leaf clover.

00:21:42.000 --> 00:21:45.400
Meaning that when you hit us, it's tantamount to stomping on a four-leaf clover.

00:21:45.400 --> 00:21:46.970
The hell are you talking about?!

00:21:46.970 --> 00:21:49.780
How are you supposed to be like a four-leaf clover?!

00:21:49.780 --> 00:21:51.280
Hey, what happened to the other guy?!

00:21:51.280 --> 00:21:53.310
He's probably still searching for clovers!

00:21:53.820 --> 00:21:55.530
My grandmother used to say

00:21:55.530 --> 00:21:58.340
that no one who likes sumo wrestling can be bad.

00:21:58.340 --> 00:21:59.770
That's what I think, too.

00:21:59.770 --> 00:22:00.440
After all,

00:22:00.440 --> 00:22:03.320
no one who would help a baby bird would ever go peeping.

00:22:04.650 --> 00:22:05.640
No, you can't!

00:22:05.640 --> 00:22:07.820
You have to tell her
the truth, or else later...

00:22:07.820 --> 00:22:11.570
You can't go to those sumo matches in two weeks anymore, can you?

00:22:12.650 --> 00:22:15.950
Oh, someone's coming!
I have to go, okay?

00:22:15.950 --> 00:22:17.540
I have to tell her the truth.

00:22:19.020 --> 00:22:20.250
Chiyo-chan!

00:22:22.880 --> 00:22:26.170
I promise I'll go to the sumo matches!

00:22:26.170 --> 00:22:29.630
What am I saying?!
I was going to confess to peeping, right?!

00:22:29.630 --> 00:22:32.030
Why am I making a
promise I can't keep?!

00:22:35.470 --> 00:22:37.170
Chiyo-chan is leaving!

00:22:39.980 --> 00:22:42.770
Yikes! Is she here looking for me?!

00:22:42.770 --> 00:22:44.980
It's no use! I can't hold it anymore!

00:22:49.760 --> 00:22:51.820
I drank too much dandelion tea.

00:22:51.820 --> 00:22:53.940
If she sees me, I'm dead!

00:24:36.970 --> 00:24:38.600
Next time on Prison School:

00:24:38.600 --> 00:24:40.360
"The Man Who <i>Butt</i> In Too Copiously." <i></i>
